                    {
                        "sense_id": "5dc1de48-3e8f-3012-8122-39e5755f96cf",
                        "entry_id": "b53207c3-6120-3863-9dfe-91930410d45a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Odoriférant, odorant, qui répand une odeur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b79dd66a-7622-4975-972b-072c830fbea5",
                                "sense_id": "5dc1de48-3e8f-3012-8122-39e5755f96cf",
                                "text": "Ces tumeurs se développent souvent à partir de la glande odorifère ventrale des gerbilles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f56a0cce-19c5-440a-a5cb-03e3d63d6ddc",
                        "source_entry_id": "b53207c3-6120-3863-9dfe-91930410d45a",
                        "source_sense_id": "5dc1de48-3e8f-3012-8122-39e5755f96cf",
                        "target_lang_word": "odoriferous",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "odoriferous",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d77f5a9-50af-3008-a768-4d96d45be3bc",
                                        "entry_id": "e6e1b282-0287-3556-88db-ac7564c9c12f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having an odor or fragrance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d6c9cce-4182-4069-be86-51cec944b7cb",
                                                "sense_id": "2d77f5a9-50af-3008-a768-4d96d45be3bc",
                                                "text": "Lewis the eleventh had a conceit everything did stinke about him, all the odoriferous perfumes they could get, would not ease him, but still hee^([sic]) smelled a filthy stinke."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "139be6ec-bff9-43f7-bcc6-60556080e95b",
                                                "sense_id": "2d77f5a9-50af-3008-a768-4d96d45be3bc",
                                                "text": "True, the rich spices, the perfumed woods, the fragrant oils, which would feed the sacred fire of my funeral pyre, would save my mortal remains from that corruption which makes the disgust of death even worse than its dread. A few odoriferous ashes alone would be left for my urn."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "964a820c-9475-4247-a59c-8ae4da54d463",
                                                "sense_id": "2d77f5a9-50af-3008-a768-4d96d45be3bc",
                                                "text": "Moreover, as that of Heidelburgh was always replenished with the most excellent of the wines of the Rhenish valleys, so the tun of the whale contains by far the most precious of all his oily vintages; namely, the highly-prized spermaceti, in its absolutely pure, limpid, and odoriferous state."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5b616ac-a605-407c-9894-f4b07d8e6bd8",
                                                "sense_id": "2d77f5a9-50af-3008-a768-4d96d45be3bc",
                                                "text": "The males, and rarely the females, of many kinds of bats have glands and protrudable sacks situated in various parts; and it is believed that these are odoriferous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5ae79a5-dee9-45d0-a761-458b30a3dd23",
                                                "sense_id": "2d77f5a9-50af-3008-a768-4d96d45be3bc",
                                                "text": "Frankini disguised as Mr. Beefo: \"Who wants to get out and smell that wet beef?\"\nCaptain Man: \"Me, I do, Me! Oh yes, so odoriferous!\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
